## 8. Iteration while mutating

```python
def remove_negatives(items):
    items = list(items)  # work on a copy
    # iterate over a snapshot
    for x in list(items):
        if x < 0:
            items.remove(x)
    return items

# For large collections prefer filtering:
def remove_negatives_fast(items):
    return [x for x in items if x >= 0]
